Based on the data I have 3 recommendations to convert casual riders to members

1) Have a summer promotion starting on june to subscribe to the membership. This can be in the form of a disconut monthly rate for the first 3 months.

2) When riding on weekends, double the amount of points you get for every minute traveled.  

3) Get discounts on electric bikes when a member. Since about 60% of casual riders use electric bikes. 
